{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "lc-header",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -360,
      "width": 3290,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "# 极限与连续\n\n**它解决什么：** 用严格语言描述输入靠近某点时输出的趋势，再判断这种趋势能否接上点值。\n**具体锚点：** $(x^2-1)/(x-1)$ 在 $x=1$ 未定义，但极限仍是 $2$。\n**为什么重要：** 导数、积分、收敛、渐近近似和概率极限都从这里开始。\n\n左侧从定义进入连续性；右侧是极限计算工具。边界与定理分成独立节点，点击标题进入原子。"
    },
    {
      "id": "lc-limit-definition",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## [[函数极限|函数极限]]\n*Limit of a function*\n\n任意输出误差都能由足够小的非零输入距离保证。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "lc-point-value",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[点值不决定极限|Limits and point values]]\n\nKeeping every nearby allowed input and output unchanged preserves the limit, even if the target value is added, removed or changed.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n保持去心邻域内的合法输入与输出不变，只增删或修改目标点的值，不改变该处极限。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "lc-two-sided",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[双侧极限判定|Two-sided limits]]\n\nWhen the domain approaches the target from both sides, a finite limit exists exactly when both one-sided limits exist and agree. At endpoints, use the available side.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n定义域两侧都有任意近的输入时，有限双侧极限存在当且仅当两侧极限存在且相等；端点只沿合法一侧趋近。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "lc-infinity",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1560,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[无穷极限与无穷远极限|Input and output infinity]]\n\nA limit at infinity concerns the input direction. An infinite limit requires every fixed output threshold to be passed eventually; unbounded values alone do not suffice.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n无穷远描述输入方向；无穷极限要求输出最终通过每个固定门槛，仅有无界输出还不够。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "lc-zero-zero",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2080,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[零比零未定式|The 0/0 indeterminate form]]\n\nBoth numerator and denominator tend to zero along the chosen approach. Their quotient still needs analysis where the denominator is nonzero. Point values alone do not establish this form.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n分子与分母沿所选方向都趋于零；仍需在分母非零的输入上分析商。代入得到的点值不能代替这两个极限条件。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "lc-limit-laws",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2600,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[极限定律适用条件|Conditions for limit laws]]\n\nUse finite component limits along the same allowed approach. The quotient rule additionally requires a nonzero denominator limit.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n沿同一合法趋近方向，各部分极限须为有限实数；商法则还要求分母极限非零。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "lc-workflow",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2340,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[极限计算流程|Choosing a limit method]]\n\nSpecify the domain and approach, then choose a justified method: substitution, algebra, bounds or one-sided analysis. There is no compulsory tool order.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n先明确定义域与趋近方向，再按条件选用代入、代数改写、估界或分侧分析；工具没有强制试用顺序。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "lc-squeeze",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1820,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 285,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[夹逼定理|Squeeze theorem]]\n\nAlong the same allowed approach, local lower and upper bounds with a common finite limit force the middle function to that limit. No continuity of the middle function is assumed.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n沿同一合法趋近方式，局部上下界若有共同有限极限，中间函数也趋于它；不预设中间函数连续。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "lc-lhopital",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2340,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[洛必达法则|L’Hôpital’s rule]]\n\nOn a one-sided interval or tail, check differentiability, a nonzero denominator derivative and the original limiting form. A derivative-ratio limit then transfers under the theorem’s hypotheses.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n在单侧区间或尾部，检查可导性、分母导数非零与原极限形式；满足定理条件后，才能传递导数比的极限。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "lc-lhopital-boundary",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2860,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[洛必达适用边界|When the rule applies]]\n\nThe familiar 0/0 and infinity/infinity cases are sufficient versions. Check each repeated application. An oscillating derivative ratio does not rule out convergence of the original quotient.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n常见的零比零与无穷比无穷是充分版本；重复使用须逐次检查。导数比振荡，不能据此判原比值不收敛。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "lc-differentiable",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[可导必连续|Differentiability implies continuity]]\n\nA finite difference-quotient limit controls output change through quotient times input increment. This gives continuity at the same point, using the same allowed sides.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限差商极限通过“差商乘输入增量”控制输出变化，推出同一点、同一合法方向上的连续性。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "lc-continuity",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[一点连续|Continuity at a point]]\n\nNearby domain inputs must give outputs close to the assigned point value. Endpoints use allowed inputs; isolated domain points are automatically continuous.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n附近的定义域输入须使输出接近已定义的点值。端点沿域内趋近；孤立定义域点自动连续。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "lc-discontinuity",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 290,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[间断类型判别|Classifying discontinuities]]\n\nFirst identify the domain and available approach sides. Compare finite limits and the point value; infinite and oscillatory behaviour can differ between sides, and labels can overlap.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n先明确定义域与可趋近的侧，再比较有限极限和点值。无穷、振荡行为可能分属两侧；分类标签不总互斥。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "lc-continuity-boundary",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1020,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[连续不必可导|Continuity without differentiability]]\n\nFor absolute value at zero, outputs approach zero from both sides, but the difference quotients are −1 and 1. Continuity does not guarantee a finite derivative.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n绝对值函数在零点两侧的输出都趋于零，差商却分别为−1与1；连续不能保证有限导数。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "lc-ivt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 1020,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[介值定理|Intermediate value theorem]]\n\nFor $a<b$, a real function continuous on $[a,b]$ attains every value between $f(a)$ and $f(b)$. A strictly intermediate value is attained inside $(a,b)$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n设 $a<b$，实函数在 $[a,b]$ 上连续，就取到端点输出之间的每个值；严格居中的输出在 $(a,b)$ 内取到。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "lc-removable",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 1020,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 290,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[可去间断的唯一补值|Unique continuous filling]]\n\nAt a domain cluster point, a finite domain-relative limit $L$ gives exactly one continuous filling: assign the value $L$. An isolated point has no such uniqueness.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n在定义域聚点处，若沿域内的有限极限为 $L$，唯一连续补值就是 $L$。孤立点不适用这一唯一性结论。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "lc-jump",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1560,
      "y": 1020,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 255,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[跳跃间断不可补值|A jump cannot be filled]]\n\nIf both sides supply arbitrarily close inputs and their finite limits differ, changing only the point value cannot make the extension continuous.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n两侧都有任意近的输入而有限极限不同时，只改目标点的值无法使扩展函数连续。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "lc-ivt-boundary",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 1360,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[介值定理只保证存在性|What the IVT guarantees]]\n\nThe theorem guarantees at least one solution. Uniqueness needs further reasoning; numerical approximation needs an algorithm and an error criterion. Constructive proofs can motivate bisection.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n定理保证至少一个解；唯一性另需论证，数值近似还需算法与误差标准。构造性证明可以启发二分法。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "lc-cauchy-mvt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2340,
      "y": 1020,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[柯西中值定理|Cauchy’s mean value theorem]]\n\nFor functions continuous on $[a,b]$ with $a<b$ and differentiable inside, two endpoint changes satisfy a derivative relation at one common interior point. Nonzero denominators justify the ratio used in the 0/0 proof.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n在 $a<b$ 的闭区间连续且内部可导时，两个端点变化量与同一内部点的导数满足关系。分母非零才可得到零比零证明所用的比值。"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
